{{!
    @template local_page/status_badge

    The status of a custom page, shown to the people who may edit it beside
    the page's heading. Built by local_page_status_badge() in lib.php, which
    chooses the label (the plugin's own status string) and the colour classes:
    a subtle background paired with its own emphasis text colour.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * label - The localised status, plain text
    * classes - The background and text colour utilities

    Example context (json):
    {
        "label": "Draft",
        "classes": "bg-warning-subtle text-warning-emphasis"
    }
}}
<span class="badge {{classes}} ms-1 align-middle local-page-status-badge">{{label}}</span>
